// ============================================================
//  UI SCREENS — the inventory (the touch corner button) and the
//  settings menu (the gear in the inventory header).
//
//  Nothing is drawn straight onto the live panel while a screen is open:
//   - s_ui_under holds the game screen exactly as it was when the UI
//     opened (tile highlight already removed). Closing pastes it back, so
//     the player, animations and breakables reappear untouched.
//   - Each redraw starts from s_ui_under inside s_ui_buf, draws the hotbar
//     and the active screen there, then copies only the rectangles that can
//     change onto the panel. The panel never shows a half-drawn frame, and
//     translucent panels always blend against the untouched game picture,
//     so they can't get a little darker on every redraw.
//  All draw_* helpers write through s_fb, so pointing s_fb at s_ui_buf for
//  the duration of a redraw renders every one of them off-screen.
// ============================================================

